	(395, 1, '2025-08-23 07:08:20', '2025-08-23 07:08:20', '<h1>Reach new heights in your fitness journey with tailored training programs.\n</h1>															<img width="667" height="1000" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/about-img-3.jpg" alt="about img 3 fitness" />																who we are					<h2>Your fitness journey starts here</h2>					<p>You bring the inspiration, motivation &amp; passion that can’t be taught — and we give you everything you need to make a success of it. Start your journey to better health and fitness.\n</p>					01.  Healthy &amp; effective							\n							02. Individual approach							\n							03. Individual approach							\n							<a id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        															<img width="667" height="1000" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/about-img-1.jpg" alt="about img 1 fitness" />																our impact					<h2>Coaching in numbers</h2>							\n			certified trainers			\n				0\n				+\n			active member 			\n				0\n				+\n			calories burnt			\n				0\n				M+\n			hours trained			\n				0\n				K+\n																	<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/weight-plate.png" alt="weight-plate icon fitness" />																<p>why choose us</p>					<h2>Helping you achieve <br> your goals\n</h2>															<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/time.png" alt="time icon fitness" />																<h3>Flexible scheduling</h3>		<p>Your Personal Trainer will cheer you on every step of the way. We’ve got you from there.</p>													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/coach.png" alt="coach icon fitness" />																<h3>Certified<br> trainers</h3>		<p>Our certified trainers bring a wealth of knowledge and experience to every session.</p>													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/gym-equipment.png" alt="gym-equipment icon fitness" />																<h3>Personalized programs</h3>		<p>Receive personalized programming crafted to match your unique goals and requirements.</p>													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/diet.png" alt="diet image fitness" />																<h3>Nutrition guidance</h3>		We are a global health and fitness trainers that brings you a complete wellness solution.													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/target.png" alt="target image fitness" />																<h3>Goal-focused training</h3>		Your Personal Trainer will cheer you on every step of the way. We’ve got you from there.													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/select.png" alt="select image fitness" />																<h3>Efficient <br>results</h3>		Working out with a personal trainer ensures that every minute of your session leads to transformative results.			testimonials					<h2>What our members <br>are saying\n</h2>															<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/dumbbell-1.png" alt="dumbbell (1) icon fitness" />																\n											<img width="250" height="250" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/testimonials-img-2-.jpg" alt="testimonials img 2 fitness" />										\n																		<strong>Testimonial #1</strong>\n																											Designation\n																			<ul>\n																					<li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z"