	(1063, 1, '2026-09-28 05:14:35', '2026-09-28 05:14:35', '<h1>fitness center your place of power</h1>					about us					<h2>Transform your body &amp; mindset with expert coaching\n</h2>							\n							More than 3000+ successful transformations\n					<figure><img width="304" height="304" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/testimonial-img-1.jpg" alt="testimonial img 1 fitness" /></figure><h3>Floyd Miles</h3><p>Sales Director</p>					<figure><img width="250" height="250" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/testimonials-img-2-.jpg" alt="testimonials img 2 fitness" /></figure><h3>Alex Ramirez</h3><p>Financial Analyst</p>					<figure><img width="254" height="254" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/testimonial-img-3.jpg" alt="testimonials img 3 fitness" /></figure><h3>Emily Johnson</h3><p>Marketing Manager</p>		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E			You bring the inspiration, motivation &amp; passion that can\'t be taught — and we give you everything you need to make a success of it.\n							<a id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        					what we do					<h2>Certified personal trainer programs</h2>															<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/dumbbell-1.png" alt="dumbbell (1) icon fitness" />																<h3>Fitness &amp; performance</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n							<h3>Weight loss</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        					<h3>Balance body mind</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        															<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/water-bottle.png" alt="water-bottle icon fitness" />																<h3>Nutrition strategies\n</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        															<img width="1158" height="1665" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/gym-img-1.png" alt="gym img 1 fitness" />																why choose us					<h2>Your partner in health and fitness success\n</h2>															<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/marketing-agent-icon.png" alt="marketing-agent icon fitness" />																<h3>Expert guidance</h3>		<p>Our certified trainers bring a wealth of knowledge and experience to every session.</p>													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/schedule-icon.png" alt="schedule icon fitness" />																<h3>Flexible scheduling</h3>		<p>Your Personal Trainer will cheer you on every step of the way. The hardest part is showing up. We’ve got you from there.</p>													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/to-do-list-icon.png" alt="to-do-list icon fitness" />																<h3>Personalized plan</h3>		Receive personalized programming crafted to match your unique goals and requirements.													<img width="512" height="512" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/dumbbell.png" alt="dumbbell icon fitness" />																<h3>Efficient results</h3>		Working out with a personal trainer ensures that every minute of your session leads to transformative results.													<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/gym-roller.png" alt="gym-roller image fitness" />																<h2>Start your better <br>life today!</h2>		<p>Receive personalized programming crafted to match your unique goals and requirements.</p>					\n							<a id="">\n					Book Now<svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248zm-448 0c0-110.5 89.5-200 200-200s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200S56 366.5 56 256zm72 20v-40c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h116v-67c0-10.7 12.9-16 20.5-8.5l99 99c4.7 4.7 4.7 12.3 0 17l-99 99c-7.6 7.6-20.5 2.2-20.5-8.5v-67H140c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12z"></path></svg>				</a>\n        					facts in numbers					<h2>Peak performance <br>peak results</h2>															<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/skipping-rope.png" alt="skipping-rope image fitness" />																<p>We are a global health and fitness trainers that brings you a complete wellness solution.\n</p>							\n			active member 			\n				0\n				+\n				<p>achieve the healthiest together</p>					\n			certified trainers			\n				0\n				+\n				<p>maximize your potential with our elite coaches</p>					\n			calories burnt			\n				0\n				M+\n				<p>workout plan designed just for you</p>					\n			hours trained			\n				0\n				K+\n				<p>workout anytime, anywhere — no gym commutes</p>													<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/kettle-ball.png" alt="kettle-ball icon fitness" />																Our team					<h2>Meet some of<br> our trainers</h2>				\n<!-- start Card Carousel -->\n		<link id=\'font-awesome-css\' href=\'http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/plugins/unlimited-elements-for-elementor/assets_libraries/font-awesome6/fontawesome-all.min.css\' type=\'text/css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' >\n		<link id=\'font-awesome-4-shim-css\' href=\'http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/plugins/unlimited-elements-for-elementor/asset