	(1064, 1, '2026-09-28 05:14:36', '2026-09-28 05:14:36', '<h1>fitness center your place of power</h1>					about us					<h2>Transform your body &amp; mindset with expert coaching\n</h2>							\n							More than 3000+ successful transformations\n					<figure><img width="304" height="304" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/testimonial-img-1.jpg" alt="testimonial img 1 fitness" /></figure><h3>Floyd Miles</h3><p>Sales Director</p>					<figure><img width="250" height="250" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/testimonials-img-2-.jpg" alt="testimonials img 2 fitness" /></figure><h3>Alex Ramirez</h3><p>Financial Analyst</p>					<figure><img width="254" height="254" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/testimonial-img-3.jpg" alt="testimonials img 3 fitness" /></figure><h3>Emily Johnson</h3><p>Marketing Manager</p>		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E			You bring the inspiration, motivation &amp; passion that can\'t be taught — and we give you everything you need to make a success of it.\n							<a id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        					what we do					<h2>Certified personal trainer programs</h2>															<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/dumbbell-1.png" alt="dumbbell (1) icon fitness" />																<h3>Fitness &amp; performance</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n							<h3>Weight loss</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        					<h3>Balance body mind</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        															<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/water-bottle.png" alt="water-bottle icon fitness" />																<h3>Nutrition strategies\n</h3>		Go beyond fitness training and step into the future of wellness coaching—where evidence-based science meets compassionate, personalized support. 					\n							<a href="#" id="">\n					Learn more 				</a>\n        															<img width="1158" height="1665" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/gym-img-1.png" alt="gym img 1 fitness" />																why choose us					<h2>Your partner in health and fitness success\n</h2>															<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/marketing-agent-icon.png" alt="marketing-agent icon fitness" />																<h3>Expert guidance</h3>		<p>Our certified trainers bring a wealth of knowledge and experience to every session.</p>													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/schedule-icon.png" alt="schedule icon fitness" />																<h3>Flexible scheduling</h3>		<p>Your Personal Trainer will cheer you on every step of the way. The hardest part is showing up. We’ve got you from there.</p>													<img width="256" height="256" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/to-do-list-icon.png" alt="to-do-list icon fitness" />																<h3>Personalized plan</h3>		Receive personalized programming crafted to match your unique goals and requirements.													<img width="512" height="512" src="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/dumbbell.png" alt="dumbbell icon fitness" />																<h3>Efficient results</h3>		Working out with a personal trainer ensures that every minute of your session leads to transformative results.													<img width="500" height="500" src="http://localhost/g