	(54, '2025-10-28 16:06:59', '162.214.80.67', 'khanjan@getnada.com', '[Wordfence Alert] Problems found on fitness.wordpresspalette.com', '<p>This email was sent from your website &quot;fitness&quot; by the Wordfence plugin.</p>\n\n<p>Wordfence found the following new issues on "fitness" (3 existing issues were also found again).</p>\n\n<p>Alert generated at Tuesday 28th of October 2025 at 11:36:59 PM</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>See the details of these scan results on your site at: http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan</p>\n\n\n	<div style="margin: 12px 0;padding: 8px; background-color: #ffffe0; border: 1px solid #ffd975; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 10px;">\n		<em>The scan was terminated early because it reached the time limit for scans. If you would like to allow your scans to run longer, you can customize the limit on the options page: <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan&amp;subpage=scan_options#wf-scanner-options-performance">http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan&amp;subpage=scan_options</a> or read more about scan options to improve scan speed here: <a href="https://www.wordfence.com/help/?query=scan-time-limit">https://www.wordfence.com/help/?query=scan-time-limit</a></em>\n	</div>\n\n\n<p>High Severity Problems:</p>\n<p>* Scan Time Limit Exceeded</p>\n\n\n\n<p>3 existing issues were found again and are not shown.</p>\n	<p>NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:</p>\n	\n	<ul>\n		<li>Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge</li>\n		<li>Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site</li>\n		<li>Country blocking</li>\n		<li>IP reputation monitoring</li>\n		<li>Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times</li>\n		<li>Access to Premium Support</li>\n		<li>Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases</li>\n	</ul>\n\n	<p>Click here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:<br>