	(60, '2025-10-30 16:16:50', '162.214.80.67', 'khanjan@getnada.com', '[Wordfence Alert] Problems found on fitness.wordpresspalette.com', '<p>This email was sent from your website &quot;fitness&quot; by the Wordfence plugin.</p>\n\n<p>Wordfence found the following new issues on "fitness" (1 existing issue was also found again).</p>\n\n<p>Alert generated at Thursday 30th of October 2025 at 11:46:50 PM</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>See the details of these scan results on your site at: http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p>Medium Severity Problems:</p>\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Elementor&quot; needs an upgrade (3.32.2 -&gt; 3.32.5).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/elementor/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;ElementsKit Lite&quot; needs an upgrade (3.7.2 -&gt; 3.7.5).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/elementskit-lite/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Rank Math SEO&quot; needs an upgrade (1.0.253 -&gt; 1.0.256).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/seo-by-rank-math/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Really Simple Security&quot; needs an upgrade (9.5.1 -&gt; 9.5.3).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/really-simple-ssl/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Theme &quot;Hello Elementor&quot; needs an upgrade (3.4.4 -&gt; 3.4.5).</p>\n\n\n\n<p>1 existing issue was found again and is not shown.</p>\n	<p>NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:</p>\n	\n	<ul>\n		<li>Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge</li>\n		<li>Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site</li>\n		<li>Country blocking</li>\n		<li>IP reputation monitoring</li>\n		<li>Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times</li>\n		<li>Access to Premium Support</li>\n		<li>Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases</li>\n	</ul>\n\n	<p>Click here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:<br><a href="https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/">htt