	(76, '2025-11-17 21:41:30', '10.36.243.205', 'khanjan@getnada.com', '[Wordfence Alert] Problems found on fitness.wordpresspalette.com', '<p>This email was sent from your website &quot;fitness&quot; by the Wordfence plugin.</p>\n\n<p>Wordfence found the following new issues on "fitness" (11 existing issues were also found again).</p>\n\n<p>Alert generated at Monday 17th of November 2025 at 05:41:30 PM</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>See the details of these scan results on your site at: http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p>Medium Severity Problems:</p>\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Elementor&quot; needs an upgrade (3.32.2 -&gt; 3.33.1).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/elementor/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Unlimited Elements for Elementor&quot; needs an upgrade (1.5.149 -&gt; 1.5.152).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/unlimited-elements-for-elementor/#developers</p>\n\n\n<p>11 existing issues were found again and are not shown.</p>\n	<p>NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:</p>\n	\n	<ul>\n		<li>Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge</li>\n		<li>Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site</li>\n		<li>Country blocking</li>\n		<li>IP reputation monitoring</li>\n		<li>Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times</li>\n		<li>Access to Premium Support</li>\n		<li>Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases</li>\n	</ul>\n\n	<p>Click here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:<br><a href="https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/">https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/</a></p>\n\n<p>No longer an administrator for this site? <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/?_wfsf=removeAlertEmail&amp;jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImtoYW5qYW5AZ2V0bmFkYS5jb20iLCJfZXhwIjoxNzY0MDA2MDkwfQ.TOEYBoOC0mrVAdR-ja2Mk-aaWe56i4hiyDPA4KiA00Q" target="_blank">Click here</a> to stop receiving security alerts.</p>', 'Content-type: text/html', '', NULL, '1.15.0'),
	(77, '2025-11-20 15:05:38', '10.36.243.205', 'khanjan@getnada.com', '[Wordfence Alert] Problems found on fitness.wordpresspalette.com', '<p>This email was sent from your website &quot;fitness&quot; by the Wordfence plugin.</p>\n\n<p>Wordfence found the following new issues on "fitness" (11 existing issues were also found again).</p>\n\n<p>Alert generated at Thursday 20th of November 2025 at 11:05:38 AM</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>See the details of these scan results on your site at: http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p>Medium Severity Problems:</p>\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;EWWW Image Optimizer&quot; needs an upgrade (8.2.1 -&gt; 8.3.0).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/ewww-image-optimizer/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Rank Math SEO&quot; needs an upgrade (1.0.253 -&gt; 1.0.258).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/seo-by-rank-math/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Really Simple Security&quot; needs an upgrade (9.5.1 -&gt; 9.5.3.2).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/really-simple-ssl/#developers</p>\n\n\n<p>11 existing issues were found again and are not shown.</p>\n	<p>NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:</p>\n	\n	<ul>\n		<li>Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge</li>\n		<li>Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site</li>\n		<li>Country blocking</li>\n		<li>IP reputation monitoring</li>\n		<li>Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times</li>\n		<li>Access to Premium Support</li>\n		<li>Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases</li>\n	</ul>\n\n	<p>Click here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:<br><a href="https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/">https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/</a></p>\n\n<p>No longer an administrator for this site? <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/?_wfsf=removeAlertEmail&amp;jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6