 20px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; color: #222 !important; margin: 20px 0 4px; padding: 0; border: 0;">Updates Needed</h2>\n				\n																	<h4 style="font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; color: #666666 !important; margin: 20px 0 4px; padding: 0; border: 0;">Plugins</h4>\n					<ul style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;Autoptimize (v3.1.14)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;Elementor (v3.33.2)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;ElementsKit Lite (v3.7.6)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;EWWW Image Optimizer (v8.3.0)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;Rank Math SEO (v1.0.258)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;Really Simple Security (v9.5.3.2)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;Unlimited Elements for Elementor (v2.0)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;Wordfence Security (v8.1.2)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the plugin &quot;WP Mail SMTP (v4.7.0)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n											</ul>\n													<h4 style="font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; color: #666666 !important; margin: 20px 0 4px; padding: 0; border: 0;">Themes</h4>\n					<ul style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n													<li style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n								A new version of the theme &quot;Hello Elementor (v3.4.5)&quot; is available. 							</li>\n											</ul>\n								\n									<p style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 1em 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n						<a class="button" href="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/update-core.php" style="font-size: 13px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: none; color: #FFF; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; line-height: 26px; height: 28px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 3px; white-space: nowrap; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(120, 200, 230, 0.5) inset, 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15); background-image: none; background-attachment: scroll; background-repeat: repeat; background-color: #2EA2CC; margin: 0; padding: 0 10px 1px; border: 1px solid #0074a2;">Update Now</a>\n					</p>\n				\n				<p style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 1em 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n					If you would like to sign-in to <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio">http://localhost/gimnasio</a> please <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/">click here</a> now. You can change the frequency of this email or turn it on and off by visiting your <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=Wordfence&amp;subpage=global_options#global-options-email-summary">Wordfence options page</a>.				</p>\n\n				<p style="font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; margin: 1em 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n					No longer an administrator for this site? <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/?_wfsf=removeAlertEmail&amp;jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImtoYW5qYW5AZ2V0bmFkYS5jb20iLCJfZXhwIjoxNzY0NjIxODg2fQ.xw3uV8LLKo8jf6Y7E3gYL1i1aK909UX2aZmpNYkSOow" target="_blank">Click here</a> to stop receiving security alerts.\n				</p>\n			</div>\n		</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>\n<!-- End of wrapper table -->\n</body>\n</html>', 'Content-Type: text/html', '', NULL, '1.15.0'),
	(83, '2025-11-25 02:34:20', '10.36.243.205', 'khanjan@getnada.com', '[Wordfence Alert] fitness.wordpresspalette.com Admin Login', 'This email was sent from your website "fitness" by the Wordfence plugin at Monday 24th of November 2025 at 10:34:20 PM\nThe Wordfence administrative URL for this site is: http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=Wordfence\nA user with username "ivenyyqszj66" who has administrator access signed in to your WordPress site.\nUser IP: 107.173.93.174\nUser hostname: 107-173-93-174-host.colocrossing.com\nUser location: Los Angeles, California, United States\n\n\n	NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:\n - Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge\n - Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site\n - Country blocking\n - IP reputation monitoring\n - Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times\n - Access to Premium Support\n - Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases\n\nClick here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:\nhttps://www.wordfence.com/zz1/wordfence-signup/\n--\nTo change your alert options for Wordfence, visit:\nhttp://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=Wordfence&subpage=global_options\nTo see current Wordfence alerts, visit:\nhttp://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=Wordfence\n\n\n\nNo longer an administrator for this site? Click here to stop receiving security alerts: http://localhost/gimnasio/?_wfsf=removeAlertEmail&jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImtoYW5qYW5AZ2V0bmFkYS5jb20iLCJfZXhwIjoxNzY0NjI4NDYwfQ.mlm3AeeRSN_4sdMK6pNrD8UZlUnjc_BKemGFF0fzF20', 'Content-Type: text/html', '', NULL, '1.15.0'),
	(84, '2025-11-27 02:03:20', '10.36.243.205', 'khanjan@getnada.com', '[Wordfence Alert] Problems found on fitness.wordpresspalette.com', '<p>This email was sent from your website &quot;fitness&quot; by the Wordfence plugin.</p>\n\n<p>Wordfence found the following new issues on "fitness" (11 existing issues were also found again).</p>\n\n<p>Alert generated at Wednesday 26th of November 2025 at 10:03:20 PM</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>See the details of these scan results on your site at: http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p>Medium Severity Problems:</p>\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Unlimited Elements for Elementor&quot; needs an upgrade (1.5.149 -&gt; 2.0.1).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/unlimited-elements-for-elementor/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;WP Mail SMTP&quot; needs an upgrade (4.6.0 -&gt; 4.7.1).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-mail-smtp/#developers</p>\n\n\n<p>11 existing issues were found again and are not shown.</p>\n	<p>NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:</p>\n	\n	<ul>\n		<li>Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge</li>\n		<li>Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site</li>\n		<li>Country blocking</li>\n		<li>IP reputation monitoring</li>\n		<li>Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times</li>\n		<li>Access to Premium Support</li>\n		<li>Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases</li>\n	</ul>\n\n	<p>Click here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:<br><a href="https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/">https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/</a></p>\n\n<p>No longer an administrator for this site? <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/?_wfsf=removeAlertEmail&amp;jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImtoYW5qYW5AZ2V0bmFkYS5jb20iLCJfZXhwIjoxNzY0Nzk5NDAwfQ.6G1DrnGEMjT3f8COm-danC1sAK_vL4Mb8k-Gu8BnNpY" target="_blank">Click here</a> to stop receiving