	(87, '2025-12-03 22:18:25', '10.36.243.205', 'test@gmal.com', '[fitness] Your site has updated to WordPress 6.9', 'Howdy! Your site at http://localhost/gimnasio has been updated automatically to WordPress 6.9.\n\nNo further action is needed on your part. For more on version 6.9, see the About WordPress screen:\nhttp://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/about.php\n\nIf you experience any issues or need support, the volunteers in the WordPress.org support forums may be able to help.\nhttps://wordpress.org/support/forums/\n\nYou also have some plugins or themes with updates available. Update them now:\nhttp://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/\n\nThe WordPress Team\n', 'Content-Type: text/html', '', NULL, '1.15.0'),
	(88, '2025-12-04 00:28:29', '10.36.243.205', 'khanjan@getnada.com', '[Wordfence Alert] Problems found on fitness.wordpresspalette.com', '<p>This email was sent from your website &quot;fitness&quot; by the Wordfence plugin.</p>\n\n<p>Wordfence found the following new issues on "fitness" (7 existing issues were also found again).</p>\n\n<p>Alert generated at Wednesday 3rd of December 2025 at 08:28:29 PM</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>See the details of these scan results on your site at: http://localhost/gimnasio/wp-admin/admin.php?page=WordfenceScan</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p>Medium Severity Problems:</p>\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Rank Math SEO&quot; needs an upgrade (1.0.253 -&gt; 1.0.259).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/seo-by-rank-math/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Really Simple Security&quot; needs an upgrade (9.5.1 -&gt; 9.5.4).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/really-simple-ssl/#developers</p>\n\n<p>* The Plugin &quot;Wordfence Security&quot; needs an upgrade (8.1.0 -&gt; 8.1.3).</p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/plugins/wordfence/#developers</p>\n\n\n<p>7 existing issues were found again and are not shown.</p>\n	<p>NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:</p>\n	\n	<ul>\n		<li>Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge</li>\n		<li>Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site</li>\n		<li>Country blocking</li>\n		<li>IP reputation monitoring</li>\n		<li>Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times</li>\n		<li>Access to Premium Support</li>\n		<li>Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases</li>\n	</ul>\n\n	<p>Click here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:<br><a href="https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/">https://www.wordfence.com/zz2/wordfence-signup/</a></p>\n\n<p>No longer an administrator for this site? <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/?_wfsf=removeAlertEmail&amp;jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImtoYW5qYW5AZ2V0b