line; margin: 1em 0; padding: 0; border: 0;">\n					No longer an administrator for this site? <a href="http://localhost/gimnasio/?_wfsf=removeAlertEmail&amp;jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImtoYW5qYW5AZ2V0bmFkYS5jb20iLCJfZXhwIjoxNzY3NjI4ODU4fQ.UmtTIZ2O9roNRBl74_cGdHsP7wBPQgKU4PRXCgRfxiw" target="_blank">Click here</a> to stop receiving security alerts.\n				</p>\n			</div>\n		</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>\n<!-- End of wrapper table -->\n</body>\n</html>', 'Content-Type: text/html', '', NULL, '1.15.0'),
